  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Assume&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>0</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>19</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>",
